## Quick Decision Tree

```
User Request
    │
    ├─ "Create a simple API wrapper" → Use Simple Tools (create_tools.py)
    │
    ├─ "Create a complex workflow" → Use WDL Workflows (see CURSOR_WDL_WORKFLOW_SYSTEM_PROMPT.md)
    │
    ├─ "Search for existing tools" → Use search_tools.py
    │
    ├─ "Test a tool" → Use test_adopt_zaction.py (simple) or test_wdl_action.py (complex)
    │
    ├─ "Evaluate/benchmark a workflow" → Use eval_wdl_action.py (bulk evaluations with Maxim)
    │
    ├─ "Manage agents/workspaces" → Use tool_agents.py
    │
    └─ "Version management" → Use list_wdl_versions.py / checkout_wdl_version.py
```

